{"resource":{"id":"react-cheat-sheet","title":"React.js — Cheat Sheet","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"5 min","pages":4,"lastUpdated":"October 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A printable React.js cheat sheet — JSX, components, props, state, hooks, routing, forms, Context, lifecycle equivalents, API calls, performance tips, and interview reminders."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"jsx","label":"JSX Syntax"},{"id":"components","label":"Components & Props"},{"id":"hooks","label":"Hooks Reference"},{"id":"router","label":"Router Commands"},{"id":"forms","label":"Forms & API"},{"id":"lifecycle","label":"Lifecycle Equivalents"},{"id":"perf","label":"Performance Tips"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js — Quick Revision Notes","tag":"Web Development","time":"10 min"},{"title":"React.js — PDF Notes","tag":"Web Development","time":"63 min"},{"title":"React.js — Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"34 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Instant lookup for React syntax and patterns.</li>\n          <li>Print or bookmark for interviews and daily coding.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"jsx\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">JSX Syntax</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;div class=&quot;x&quot; onClick={handle}&gt;{count &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; &lt;span&gt;{count}&lt;/span&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;\n{items.map(i =&gt; &lt;li key={i.id}&gt;{i.name}&lt;/li&gt;)}</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — JSX at a glance: attributes, expressions, conditional and list rendering.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"components\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Components &amp; Props</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>function Btn({ label, onClick }) {\n  return &lt;button onClick={onClick}&gt;{label}&lt;/button&gt;;\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"hooks\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Hooks Reference</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>const [v, setV] = useState(init);\nuseEffect(() =&gt; }, [dep]);\nconst memo = useMemo(() =&gt; compute(x), [x]);\nconst cb = useCallback(() =&gt; doIt(), []);\nconst ref = useRef(null);\nconst val = useContext(Ctx);\nconst [state, dispatch] = useReducer(reducer, initial);</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"router\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Router Commands</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;Routes&gt;\n  &lt;Route path=&quot;/&quot; element={&lt;Home/&gt;}/&gt;\n  &lt;Route path=&quot;/u/:id&quot; element={&lt;User/&gt;}/&gt;\n&lt;/Routes&gt;\nconst { id } = useParams();\nconst navigate = useNavigate();</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"forms\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Forms &amp; API</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;input value={v} onChange={e =&gt; setV(e.target.value)} /&gt;\nfetch(&quot;/api&quot;).then(r =&gt; r.json()).then(setData);</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"lifecycle\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Class Lifecycle → Hook Equivalents</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Class</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Hook</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">componentDidMount</td><td class=\"border p-2\"><code>useEffect(fn, [])</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">componentDidUpdate</td><td class=\"border p-2\"><code>useEffect(fn, [dep])</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">componentWillUnmount</td><td class=\"border p-2\">cleanup in useEffect</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">shouldComponentUpdate</td><td class=\"border p-2\"><code>React.memo</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Lifecycle mapping from class API to hooks.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"perf\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Performance Tips</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Memoize with React.memo + stable props.</li>\n          <li>Lazy-load routes with React.lazy + Suspense.</li>\n          <li>Debounce inputs, virtualize lists.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Index as key on reorderable lists.</li>\n          <li>Stale closures in effects — add deps.</li>\n          <li>Setting state in loops → batch or use reducer.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Bookmark this page. Every symbol here maps to a real API you'll use daily.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Which router?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">React Router or TanStack Router — both are excellent.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Cheat sheet — verify against react.dev.</p>\n      </div></section>"}